    {
      "id": "b63b7f06-8570-4afe-9b42-9e389cbe4b5a",
      "name": "Raise the retainer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        480,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://crm.vantriqai.com/api/invoices",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpTemplatedCustomAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={ \"client_id\": \"{{ $json.id }}\", \"type\": \"retainer\", \"auto_from_usage\": true, \"month\": \"{{ $(\"Work out the billing period\").first().json.month }}\", \"period\": \"{{ $(\"Work out the billing period\").first().json.period }}\" }",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a6d4f97e-7beb-4260-9b07-ac9b3679deeb",
      "name": "Summarise the run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const out = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const status = item.json.statusCode;\n  const body = item.json.body || {};\n  if (status === 201) {\n    out.push({ json: { result: 'invoiced', invoice_number: body.invoice_number, amount: body.amount, tax: body.tax_amount, total: body.total_amount, client_id: body.client_id } });\n  } else if (status === 409) {\n    out.push({ json: { result: 'already invoiced', detail: body.error, invoice_id: body.existing_invoice_id } });\n  } else {\n    out.push({ json: { result: 'FAILED', status, detail: body.error || body } });\n  }\n}\nreturn out;"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0c4b54a5-8b87-4387-a128-f601d0f8724f",
      "name": "Sticky Note 57648db3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -470,
        -130
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Monthly billing run\n\nRaises each active client's retainer for the month that just ended, priced off their real usage: the CRM works out retainer + (conversations over quota x overage rate), applies the client's sales tax rate, allocates the next sequential invoice number and stamps the due date.\n\n**Before activating:** point both URLs at your CRM, and set the credential template to `{\"headers\":{\"x-api-key\":\"{{api_key}}\"}}` with an **automation**-scoped key (`npm run create-key -- \"n8n automation\" automation`). Never put the admin key here.\n\nA 409 means that client was already invoiced for that period — the run is safe to repeat and cannot double-bill anyone.",
        "color": 4,
        "width": 1440,
        "height": 280
      }
    }
  ],
